+
+## Watermark contract
+
+```sql
+SELECT *
+FROM dbo.orders
+WHERE updated_at > @last_watermark
+  AND updated_at <= @current_watermark;
+```
+
+Lower boundary is exclusive; upper boundary is inclusive. The pattern captures inserts/updates represented by `updated_at`, not hard deletes.
